  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span id=\"Fleshshaper.27s_Brigandine\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Fleshshaper's_Brigandine\">Fleshshaper's Brigandine</span></h2>\n<table style=\"clear: right; border: 1px solid #FFD700; padding: 4px; width: 100%; --bg-color-1:#DDBB00;--bg-color-1-dark:#635400;--bg-color-2:#FFFACD;--bg-color-2-dark:#433E14;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\" width=\"15%\">Armor Type\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\" width=\"42.5%\">Brigandine\n</td>\n<th class=\"bg-color-2\" rowspan=\"15\" style=\"background:#FFFACD;\" width=\"42.5%\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Beholder_Plate_Armor_shown.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Beholder_Plate_Armor_shown.jpg/420px-Beholder_Plate_Armor_shown.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"274\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Beholder_Plate_Armor_shown.jpg/630px-Beholder_Plate_Armor_shown.jpg 1.5x, https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Beholder_Plate_Armor_shown.jpg/840px-Beholder_Plate_Armor_shown.jpg 2x\" /></a></span>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Feat Requirement\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\">Medium Armor Proficiency\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Race Absolutely Excluded\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\"><a href=\"/page/Warforged\" title=\"Warforged\">Warforged</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #F0DC82;\">Minimum Level\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #FFFACD;\">14\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Binding\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\"><a href=\"/page/Bind\" title=\"Bind\">Bound to Account&#160;on Acquire</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\"><a href=\"/page/Armor_bonus\" title=\"Armor bonus\">Armor Bonus</a>\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\">+18\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Maximum Dexterity Bonus\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\">4\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\"><a href=\"/page/Armor_check_penalty\" title=\"Armor check penalty\">Armor Check Penalty</a>\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\">-4\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\"><a href=\"/page/Arcane_spell_failure\" title=\"Arcane spell failure\">Arcane Spell Failure</a>\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\">10%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Durability\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\">244\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Material\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\"><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r705484\">.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip{cursor:pointer;position:relative}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip.no-icon{border-bottom:1px dashed #999999}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip>span.popup.tooltip{background-color:#EEEEEE;background-color:var(--background-color-neutral,#EEEEEE);border:1px solid #333333;border-radius:3px;box-shadow:3px 5px 10px;color:#202122;color:var(--color-base,#202122);cursor:text;display:none;margin:0px;max-width:500px;padding:5px;width:250px;z-index:10000}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.narrow{width:100px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.fill{padding:5px 12px;width:max-content}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.wide{width:450px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.custom{max-width:80vw}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip{display:block;position:absolute}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.above{bottom:100%;top:auto;margin-bottom:5px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.middle{bottom:auto;top:50%;margin-top:-1em}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.below{bottom:auto;top:100%;margin-top:5px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.left{left:0px;right:auto}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center{left:50%;margin-left:-125px;right:auto}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center.narrow{margin-left:-50px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center.fill{left:-262px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;right:-262px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center.wide{margin-left:-225px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.right{left:auto;right:0px}</style><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Magesteel\" title=\"Magesteel\">Magesteel</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Magesteel\" title=\"Magesteel\">Magesteel</a>:</b> <b>Magesteel</b> is a material commonly used in spellcasting implements and generally has a slightly higher hardness than a high quality <a href=\"/page/Wood\" title=\"Wood\">wood</a> equivalent.</span></span> \n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Hardness\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\">23\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Base Value\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\"><span style=\"display: none;\">0005615000</span>5,615<span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\">pp<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/page/Currency\" title=\"Currency\">Platinum Piece</a></span></span>&#160;\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Weight\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\">35 lbs\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Location\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\"><b><a href=\"/page/Reign_of_Madness\" title=\"Reign of Madness\">Reign of Madness</a></b>, End reward\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Enchantments\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">+5 Enhancement Bonus</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">+5 Enhancement Bonus</a>:</b> +5 <a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">enhancement bonus</a> to <a href=\"/page/Armor_Class\" title=\"Armor Class\">Armor Class</a>.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Negative_Energy_Absorption\" title=\"Negative Energy Absorption\">Negative Energy Absorption +20%</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Negative_Energy_Absorption\" title=\"Negative Energy Absorption\">Negative Energy Absorption +20%</a>:</b> This effect absorbs 20% of all negative damage the character would have taken, after all other protections have been penetrated.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Fleshmaker\" title=\"Fleshmaker\">Fleshmaker</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Fleshmaker\" title=\"Fleshmaker\">Fleshmaker</a>:</b> Magical insight into the ways of the flesh allow the wearer of this item to receive more effect from healing spells cast on them. +20 <a href=\"/page/Healing_Amplification#Positive_Healing_Amplification\" title=\"Healing Amplification\">Positive Healing Amplification</a>.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Disintegration_Guard\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Disintegration Guard\">Disintegration&#32;Guard</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Disintegration_Guard\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Disintegration Guard\">Disintegration&#32;Guard</a>:</b> This item has a store of dark, insidious power deep within. When the wearer of this item is successfully attacked in melee, this power occasionally lashes out violently at enemies and attempts to disintegrate them.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Trace_of_Madness\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Trace of Madness\">Trace of Madness</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Trace_of_Madness\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Trace of Madness\">Trace of Madness</a>:</b> You can almost hear faint, panicked voices when this item is close to you. Perhaps the latent power of this item's hint of madness could be brought out by some catalyst.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Power_Drain\" title=\"Power Drain\">Power Drain</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Power_Drain\" title=\"Power Drain\">Power Drain</a>:</b> This item reserves some of your power in order to function. You lose 30 maximum spell points (or up to 60 if you are a <a href=\"/page/Sorcerer\" title=\"Sorcerer\">Sorcerer</a> or <a href=\"/page/Favored_Soul\" title=\"Favored Soul\">Favored Soul</a>).</span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD;\" rowspan=\"5\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Fleshshaper%27s_Brigandine.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Fleshshaper%27s_Brigandine.png/420px-Fleshshaper%27s_Brigandine.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"647\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Fleshshaper%27s_Brigandine.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\"><a href=\"/page/Altar_of_Insanity\" title=\"Altar of Insanity\">Altar of Insanity</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\"><i>A suit of metal plates once worn by a mad fleshcrafter of Xoriat. It's said that there is a matching staff, and like that staff this armor will expand the wearer's ability to manipulate positive and negative energies.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Notes\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\">\n<p>You can remove the <a href=\"/page/Power_Drain\" title=\"Power Drain\">Power Drain</a> penalty with a <a href=\"/page/Sustaining_Symbiont\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Sustaining Symbiont\">Sustaining Symbiont</a>.\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\">\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260816181